    ('sari-day-spa-sanur', 'dc9ee3a991d8831f757f710fc2b06acd', 'Sari Day Spa in Sanur lists 39 treatments, with traditional massage, deep tissue and Balinese massage among them. A one-hour foot massage is 165K IDR, and you book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('the-nest-beachside-spa-sanur', '34624b18b85543b64ac75493a96d3e74', 'Manicures, pedicures and waxing are on the 36-treatment list at The Nest Beachside Spa, a day spa in Sanur. Half an hour of foot reflexology costs 130K IDR.'),
    ('the-nest-boutique-spa-sanur', '199b51feaea3e72ac4e796e8ac801131', 'A Sanur day spa with a long list: 79 treatments, from lashes to manicures and pedicures. Foot reflexology with a peppermint foot mask is 235K IDR for an hour, and the longest treatments run two and a half hours.'),
    ('asha-wellness-spa-seminyak', '90b2b0cd6ecc7200ba589626eca52184', 'Asha Wellness & Spa is a Seminyak day spa with 53 treatments, among them pedicures, manicures and foot massage. For an hour of foot reflexology you pay 200K IDR, and bookings are by WhatsApp.'),
    ('atman-spa-kerobokan-seminyak', '9d565114a210dd239fa0cfbc55e32ece', 'Atman Spa Kerobokan, a spa in Seminyak, keeps eight treatments on its list, from traditional massage and body treatments to nails. Balinese massage costs 700K IDR for an hour, booked on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('body-soul-massage-seminyak', '1dc3e97a0d329d2e06841d38823f67ff', 'At Body & Soul Massage, a day spa in Seminyak, the 26 treatments run from body scrubs and masks to facials. A traditional Balinese massage is 270K IDR for 60 minutes.'),
    ('bodyworks-bali-seminyak', '9d5b2edde6e9a403cfb92c010253a084', 'Traditional massage, Javanese lulur and aromatherapy are on the list at Bodyworks Bali, a Seminyak day spa with 13 treatments. Expect to pay 320K IDR for a one-hour foot massage.'),
    ('coolcontours-spa-beauty-seminyak', '5c0386b07b24de2a95c27a5fa1e69161', 'Coolcontours Spa & Beauty is a beauty salon in Seminyak with five treatments, including reflexology, nail art and pedicures. You book on its own website.'),
    ('deanna-spa-caf-seminyak', '746d4f1909b4d01692e0b5c8cc051526', U&'In Seminyak, Deanna Spa & Caf\00E9 runs a day spa with eight treatments, from cream baths and facials to Balinese massage. Bookings are made by WhatsApp.'),
    ('executive-bali-massage-seminyak', '732990d431ac42a48e667aae52e30474', 'A seven-treatment day spa in Seminyak, covering Balinese, deep tissue and Swedish massage. Ninety minutes of Balinese massage costs 300K IDR, and you book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('grand-seminyak-spa-seminyak', '231e94ac18a9d8d19776319774dfed6d', 'Grand Seminyak Spa is a day spa whose 35 treatments take in facials as well as traditional and Balinese massage. An hour of foot reflexology costs 605K IDR.'),
    ('hotel-indigo-bali-seminyak-beach-seminyak', '173a8412f8798ad7259777ba107eee08', 'The wellness spa at Hotel Indigo Bali Seminyak Beach has 14 treatments, with Balinese massage, acupressure and body scrubs among them. Bookings go through the hotel''s own website.'),
    ('jari-menari-spa-seminyak-bali-seminyak', 'ee831678d645ecdd5379a12a5f339da0', 'Jari Menari Spa, a day spa in Seminyak, has 13 treatments on its list, traditional massage among them. You book on its own website.'),
    ('jazb-beauty-space-seminyak', 'b2d05815034290787f6a36a050d30e4a', 'Jazb Beauty Space is a beauty salon in Seminyak with 29 treatments, from facials and lashes to haircuts. An hour of foot reflexology or foot massage is 210K IDR; book on the salon''s own website.'),
    ('no-1-wellness-seminyak', 'e1f6bcc0c6f970571152e553ec5db573', 'Traditional massage and body treatments are on the four-item list at No.1 Wellness, a wellness spa in Seminyak. Bookings are by WhatsApp.'),
    ('one-eleven-luxe-spa-seminyak', 'f7ec6ab286a84ecc2d3bb7ac84455240', 'One Eleven Luxe Spa is a Seminyak day spa with 32 treatments, among them body scrubs, sports massage and facials. The longest treatment lasts five hours, and an hour of Balinese massage is 370K IDR. Book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('ortus-wellness-seminyak', '77e25579e985c9ae7450c047b493ed64', 'At Ortus Wellness, a day spa in Seminyak, the 40 treatments include facials, traditional massage and deep tissue. There is a couple treatment too, and you book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('spa-at-peppers-seminyak-seminyak', 'fe92bb68070980defbccba7c833e01d0', 'Spa at Peppers Seminyak is a day spa with seven treatments, including Balinese massage, a body scrub and a detox treatment. You book on its own website.'),
    ('spa-bali-moon-seminyak', 'ff5c864fdab4ee22574054458f95d542', 'Spa Bali Moon in Seminyak has 28 treatments on its list, with couple massage next to traditional and Balinese massage. The relaxing version of the Balinese massage costs 159K IDR for an hour; book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('spa-bali-seminyak', '256c4f1417aaac96b522172f17920adc', 'SPA BALI is a Seminyak day spa with 11 treatments, from couple massage to body scrubs and traditional massage. Its Serenity Couple Escape runs 150 minutes for 1650K IDR, and bookings go through Zenoti.'),
    ('ssamaya-day-spa-seminyak', '103bd53d39c239e2d42ce06ad80310eb', 'Ssamaya Day Spa in Seminyak keeps a five-treatment list, with shiatsu, traditional massage and a facial on it. Bookings go through its own website.'),
    ('svaha-spa-seminyak-seminyak', '2c9e0c875acc5107cf33ac7afc63f464', 'Balinese massage, aromatherapy and a couple massage are among the 19 treatments at Svaha Spa Seminyak, a day spa. You book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('terra-spa-wellness-seminyak', '552b2ff9572cddb70126b461ba4268da', 'In Seminyak, Terra Spa & Wellness is a wellness spa whose 14 treatments include Balinese, deep tissue and Thai massage. Balinese massage is 400K IDR for 60 minutes, and you book on its own website.'),
    ('the-art-of-body-seminyak', 'db208dc1e61d9ce675833cab3b766d97', 'The Art of Body is a wellness centre in Seminyak whose nine-item list runs from Pilates to a couple massage. You book on its own website.'),
    ('the-care-day-spa-seminyak', 'dc9d84b13e0479c7f82e143bd2caf93e', 'The Care Day Spa in Seminyak has 12 treatments on its list, covering traditional, deep tissue and hot stone massage.'),
    ('the-lotus-spa-seminyak', '6fe9a4076387817a6f60864c71fe36df', 'Body scrubs, spa packages and Balinese massage share the 26-treatment list at The Lotus Spa, a wellness spa in Seminyak. A 60-minute Balinese massage costs 250K IDR, and bookings are by WhatsApp.'),
    ('the-seminyak-beach-resort-spa-seminyak', 'f0932a480fbdaef130c60918ec258bf2', 'The Seminyak Beach Resort & Spa runs a wellness spa with four treatments, including a body treatment, a facial and traditional massage. Book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('the-shampoo-lounge-seminyak', '9ea5635a920dca45b8065b57d7537a4c', 'Head massage, hair treatments and Ayurvedic treatments are on the 23-item list at The Shampoo Lounge, a Seminyak beauty salon. Its olive oil head and scalp treatment costs 385K IDR for an hour; book on the salon''s own website.'),
    ('the-spa-at-the-samaya-seminyak-seminyak', 'f64089ac1989ca86fbb8ec771e4f7aef', 'The Spa at The Samaya Seminyak is a day spa with ten treatments, among them Balinese massage, aromatherapy and shirodhara. An hour of traditional Balinese massage costs 850K IDR. Book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('wellness-by-the-legian-seminyak', '24e6f3034cf44568395446bd439e350e', 'A Seminyak wellness spa, Wellness by The Legian has four items on its list, including yoga, a spa package and Balinese massage. You book on its own website.'),
    ('anandinii-organic-garden-kitchen-sidemen', '4353cfe6074baed4b0f4fbbbd7da418c', 'Anandinii Organic Garden & Kitchen runs a wellness centre in Sidemen with eight treatments, from yoga and energy healing to Balinese massage. An hour of Balinese massage is 300K IDR; you book on its own website.'),
    ('kapha-spa-sidemen', 'd3ef5775c9c0e16e2af08f0024f7ed89', 'Kapha Spa is a day spa in Sidemen with 32 treatments, from traditional massage and aromatherapy to nails. Its Kapha spice and citrus foot care costs 650K IDR for an hour, and you book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('lattranaya-sidemen', 'ecbf78a58a20126ff89eeb81c4a434a1', 'Lattranaya, a wellness spa in Sidemen, lists 11 treatments, among them Reiki, yoga and sound healing.'),
    ('pelangi-villa-sidemen-sidemen', 'ffeff48f0c9f814173f5489d2244433d', 'Pelangi Villa Sidemen has a wellness spa with eight treatments, covering Balinese massage and yoga. Balinese massage is 300K IDR for an hour, and bookings are by WhatsApp.'),
    ('wapa-di-ume-sidemen-sidemen', 'ec6c0bfacff27603796f39e6291be73c', 'Wapa di Ume Sidemen runs a wellness spa with four items on its list, yoga among them. Bookings are on its own website.'),
    ('alam-shanti-wellness-ubud', '927ef35ba3aa82880b54dfc32ea4e081', 'Alam Shanti Wellness, an Ubud wellness spa, puts an ice bath on its 15-treatment list next to traditional and hot stone massage. An hour of foot reflexology costs 250K IDR. Book on its own website.'),
    ('alaya-ubud-ubud', 'ef90613fd6f8fc7d0b0c66c930632f05', 'The day spa at Alaya Ubud has six treatments, among them a couple massage, spa packages and Balinese boreh. The Dala Couple Ritual is 90 minutes for 1424K IDR, booked through Zenoti.'),
    ('aura-therapy-spa-ubud', 'edaf28ce35a15827b39e25e8a1bbcebd', 'Aura Therapy Spa, a day spa in Ubud, has 16 treatments, among them facials, Balinese boreh and spa packages. Fifteen minutes of head massage with coconut oil costs 110K IDR; you book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('bali-botanica-ubud-ubud', '18560ab6029b51347600499332d69cbe', 'At Bali Botanica Ubud, a day spa, the 31 treatments run from Ayurvedic treatments and facials to spa packages. The longest take 375 minutes, and an hour-long foot spa is 275K IDR. Book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('bali-spirit-hotel-and-spa-ubud', 'baf9c4e99492f4a149398387933ad387', 'Bali Spirit Hotel and Spa runs a day spa in Ubud with four treatments, including traditional and Balinese massage and aromatherapy. A traditional Balinese massage costs 200K IDR for an hour.'),
    ('bali-tao-center-ubud', 'aadd9b211db9a62455860b5f3f9b486e', 'Bali TAO Center, a day spa in Ubud, has 46 treatments, from traditional and Thai massage to scalp treatments. A couple treatment is on the list as well, and bookings go through its own website.'),
    ('bali-wellness-spa-ubud', '535444b3d2343f254ea7c878c5af6e7f', 'Bali Wellness Spa in Ubud has a 35-treatment list that runs from facials and deep tissue massage to spa packages. Its Bali Foot Spa Ritual is an hour for 500K IDR. Book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('balian-springs-ubud', '1454807b382917c77d14bdbebbd0933a', 'Traditional massage, facials and foot massage are among the 93 treatments at Balian Springs, a day spa in Ubud. Bookings go through Zenoti.'),
